  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44115820",
      "title": "Cross-Component Communication & State Management",
      "lectureOrder": 145,
      "videoOrder": 137,
      "sourceHash": "361d5be77657775f0eb98217e2071212412121b8cdfefb6e1bfc0e3f8938dfb0",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.81,
          "end": 3.09,
          "en": "Now, when it comes to dealing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.09,
          "end": 4.47,
          "en": "with these signals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.47,
          "end": 8.1,
          "en": "I also have this mark as completed button here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.1,
          "end": 9.93,
          "en": "And when that is clicked, I wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.93,
          "end": 13.05,
          "en": "that this signal does get marked as completed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.05,
          "end": 14.52,
          "en": "which here only means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.52,
          "end": 17.19,
          "en": "that this button shouldn't be shown anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.19,
          "end": 19.11,
          "en": "And this icon color here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 19.11,
          "end": 22.473,
          "en": "or this circle color here should change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.39,
          "end": 28.14,
          "en": "Now, to change the status of a ticket, we have to go back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.14,
          "end": 29.7,
          "en": "to the TicketsComponent though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.7,
          "end": 33.45,
          "en": "because it's there where I'm managing all those tickets.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.45,
          "end": 36.99,
          "en": "So it's there where I also wanna update the status",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.99,
          "end": 37.823,
          "en": "of a ticket.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.15,
          "end": 43.95,
          "en": "To be precise, in that TicketsComponent, it makes sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.95,
          "end": 47.55,
          "en": "to add a onCloseTicket method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.55,
          "end": 49.2,
          "en": "or something like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.2,
          "end": 51.21,
          "en": "The name, of course, is up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.21,
          "end": 53.643,
          "en": "to close a specific ticket,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.84,
          "end": 57.66,
          "en": "and I expect to get the ID of the ticket",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.66,
          "end": 60.87,
          "en": "that should be closed, which should be of type string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.87,
          "end": 64.53,
          "en": "as an argument here, as a parameter in onCloseTicket.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.12,
          "end": 70.98,
          "en": "And with that, we could then change the value of tickets,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.98,
          "end": 73.32,
          "en": "solve this tickets property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.32,
          "end": 76.56,
          "en": "and set this equal to a new array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.56,
          "end": 78.27,
          "en": "where I'm taking the old array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.27,
          "end": 83.22,
          "en": "but I'm mapping every ticket to a new value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.22,
          "end": 87.66,
          "en": "And map is a default method built into JavaScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.66,
          "end": 90.42,
          "en": "It takes a function that will be executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.42,
          "end": 93.47999999999999,
          "en": "for every element in that array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.47999999999999,
          "end": 95.31,
          "en": "and it will get that element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 95.31,
          "end": 98.13,
          "en": "as an argument then automatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.13,
          "end": 100.56,
          "en": "The browser will call this function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 100.56,
          "end": 103.83,
          "en": "And then here I want to check if ticket.id",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.83,
          "end": 107.82,
          "en": "is equal to the id I'm getting here as a parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.82,
          "end": 109.65,
          "en": "because if that's the case, I know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 109.65,
          "end": 111.81,
          "en": "that I'm currently looking at the ticket",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 111.81,
          "end": 113.913,
          "en": "that should be marked as closed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 115.32,
          "end": 118.8,
          "en": "So in that case, I wanna map that ticket item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 118.8,
          "end": 120.25,
          "en": "to a new object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 121.17,
          "end": 125.67,
          "en": "where I spread in all the old properties with help",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 125.67,
          "end": 127.11,
          "en": "of that spread operator,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 127.11,
          "end": 131.13,
          "en": "which is a default JavaScript operator, not TypeScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 131.13,
          "end": 133.83,
          "en": "and not Angular specific.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 133.83,
          "end": 136.47,
          "en": "And I'm using it here to create a new object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 136.47,
          "end": 138.27,
          "en": "into which I copy and paste",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 138.27,
          "end": 141.45,
          "en": "all the existing key-value pairs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 141.45,
          "end": 144.24,
          "en": "but I'm then overriding the status key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 144.24,
          "end": 147.183,
          "en": "And I'm setting this to closed now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 149.64,
          "end": 153.18,
          "en": "So I'm overriding that existing ticket in that tickets array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 153.18,
          "end": 157.323,
          "en": "with a new object where the status is set to closed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 158.31,
          "end": 161.97,
          "en": "Alternatively, I'll return the unchanged ticket",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 161.97,
          "end": 165.123,
          "en": "if I'm looking at some other ticket with a different ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 166.2,
          "end": 167.34,
          "en": "That would be one way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 167.34,
          "end": 170.88,
          "en": "of updating this ticket's array, such that a ticket",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 170.88,
          "end": 172.29,
          "en": "that is clicked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 172.29,
          "end": 175.82999999999998,
          "en": "or that should be closed is replaced with a ticket",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 175.82999999999998,
          "end": 178.113,
          "en": "where the status is set to closed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 179.91,
          "end": 183.3,
          "en": "Now, to trigger onCloseTicket, we must make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 183.3,
          "end": 186.51,
          "en": "that we emit some event, some custom event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 186.51,
          "end": 190.35,
          "en": "from inside the TicketComponent that does trigger",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 190.35,
          "end": 194.17,
          "en": "this onCloseTicket method in the TicketsComponent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 195.36,
          "end": 197.91,
          "en": "So back in the TicketComponent,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 197.91,
          "end": 202.833,
          "en": "we can add a new property here, close could be the name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 204.06,
          "end": 207,
          "en": "And I'll use the output function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 207,
          "end": 209.103,
          "en": "to create my custom event here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 210.48,
          "end": 212.76,
          "en": "imported from @angular/core.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 212.76,
          "end": 215.49,
          "en": "Of course, the output decorator combined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 215.49,
          "end": 218.013,
          "en": "with event emitter would be the alternative.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 219.18,
          "end": 220.893,
          "en": "But here I'll do it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 222.63,
          "end": 224.94,
          "en": "And I wanna emit this event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 224.94,
          "end": 227.19,
          "en": "whenever the user does click",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 227.19,
          "end": 230.52,
          "en": "on that mark as completed button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 230.52,
          "end": 232.17000000000002,
          "en": "For that, I'll add a method here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 232.17000000000002,
          "end": 235.93,
          "en": "to the TicketComponent onMarkAsCompleted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 237.87,
          "end": 241.23,
          "en": "where I'll call this.close.emit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 241.23,
          "end": 244.35,
          "en": "And I'm actually not passing any data along",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 244.35,
          "end": 246.96,
          "en": "with this event, though we could do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 246.96,
          "end": 248.73,
          "en": "but here I'm fine with an event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 248.73,
          "end": 250.983,
          "en": "that does not carry any data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 252.54,
          "end": 255.39,
          "en": "Now, onMarkAsCompleted should be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 255.39,
          "end": 257.89,
          "en": "from inside the TicketComponent template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 259.02,
          "end": 263.55,
          "en": "whenever this mark as completed button here is clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 263.55,
          "end": 265.29,
          "en": "So here, I'll add that click listener",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 265.29,
          "end": 267.543,
          "en": "and trigger onMarkAsCompleted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 270.21,
          "end": 272.88,
          "en": "With that, I'm then emitting this close event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 272.88,
          "end": 275.13,
          "en": "and in the TicketsComponent,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 275.13,
          "end": 279.65999999999997,
          "en": "or to be precise, there in the template, on that ticket,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 279.65999999999997,
          "end": 281.74,
          "en": "we can now listen to that close event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 282.99,
          "end": 285.78,
          "en": "and trigger the onCloseTicket method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 285.78,
          "end": 289.32,
          "en": "Though I now need to pass the ID of the ticket",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 289.32,
          "end": 292.173,
          "en": "that should be marked as closed to that method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 293.4,
          "end": 296.13,
          "en": "But thankfully, I can easily get hold of that ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 296.13,
          "end": 298.38,
          "en": "by using ticket.id",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 298.38,
          "end": 301.44,
          "en": "because I have that ticket variable available here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 301.44,
          "end": 302.7,
          "en": "in that for loop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 302.7,
          "end": 306.51,
          "en": "And that holds all the ticket data, so I can pass it along",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 306.51,
          "end": 308.343,
          "en": "to oncloseTicket here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 309.72,
          "end": 312.03,
          "en": "And with that, the ticket should be updated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 312.03,
          "end": 314.343,
          "en": "and should be marked as completed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 315.75,
          "end": 318.87,
          "en": "Now, to reflect the completion status",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 318.87,
          "end": 322.41,
          "en": "back in the ticket.component.html file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 322.41,
          "end": 326.7,
          "en": "I also wanna update those dynamically assigned classes here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 326.7,
          "end": 331.613,
          "en": "and set the class to ticket-open if data().status is open",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 335.61,
          "end": 339.63,
          "en": "and set it to closed if data().status is closed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 339.63,
          "end": 341.64,
          "en": "So if the ticket is marked as open,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 341.64,
          "end": 344.19,
          "en": "this CSS class should be applied.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 344.19,
          "end": 346.83299999999997,
          "en": "Otherwise, this one should be applied.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 349.11,
          "end": 353.88,
          "en": "And with all that done, if I add a new ticket,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 353.88,
          "end": 357,
          "en": "initially, I have this color for this circle,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 357,
          "end": 358.89,
          "en": "but if I click mark as completed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 358.89,
          "end": 361.29,
          "en": "this mark as completed button disappears",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 361.29,
          "end": 363.72,
          "en": "and the circle color changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 363.72,
          "end": 365.55,
          "en": "Of course, if I add more tickets,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 365.55,
          "end": 368.19,
          "en": "those tickets are not marked as completed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 368.19,
          "end": 371.523,
          "en": "So that works independent per ticket.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
